WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.130
Your screen is busy.

00:00:02.445 --> 00:00:06.335
Music, messages, login codes,
Claude sessions, downloads.

00:00:06.685 --> 00:00:08.375
All of it, scattered everywhere.

00:00:10.017 --> 00:00:12.407
That's why we made one
calm place for it all.

00:00:13.850 --> 00:00:15.080
Meet .light.

00:00:15.330 --> 00:00:18.480
A little island that lives at
the top of your Windows screen.

00:00:20.083 --> 00:00:22.073
Whenever you hover it, it opens up.

00:00:22.323 --> 00:00:25.673
Your music is right there,
and a scroll sets the volume.

00:00:27.217 --> 00:00:28.387
Coding with Claude?

00:00:28.642 --> 00:00:31.872
See every session,
and know the moment it needs your OK.

00:00:33.383 --> 00:00:37.253
Your phone's messages,
login codes and calls land here too.

00:00:38.750 --> 00:00:40.640
Drag a screenshot into any app.

00:00:40.885 --> 00:00:42.515
Everything you copy is saved.

00:00:44.083 --> 00:00:46.413
And if that wasn't enough,
we gave it a pet.

00:00:46.728 --> 00:00:48.198
A mood ring for your CPU,

00:00:48.648 --> 00:00:50.518
and confetti when things are done.

00:00:52.017 --> 00:00:53.607
Stop hunting through windows.

00:00:54.012 --> 00:00:54.842
.light.

00:00:55.197 --> 00:00:56.147
Free for Windows.

